  On the DEC 3000 model 600 series, LED code F0 indicates a problem with 
  the I/O module, or the connection between the system module and the I/O 
  module.  Following the appropriate personal safety and anti-static 
  precautions, first reseat the I/O module, then replace it. 

  I'm not aware of a general website listing these LED codes available for 
  this or various other platforms, but I'd try asking the folks from Compaq 
  Assisted Services (see FAQ)...

