The M8107(slot 14) and M8108(slot 13) comprise the memory management
boardset.
This will allow you to address the full 128kw (actually 124kw) address
range.

Lacking these, you will need the M8116(slot 14) with slot 13 left empty.
This
configuration will address 28kw, more than adequate for that single core
stack.


