To sort by size:

$ pipe dire_/col=1/not/noh/siz=all ! sort/key=(pos:x,size:y) sys$input

or by owner:

$ pipe dire_/col=1/not/noh/owner ! sort/key=(pos:x,size:y) sys$input

(not tested)

